Nothing will stop your rampage.

Rampage Bonus: You shrug off up to [35, 46, 54, 61, 67 (TL1-5; STR 100)] damage each turn during your rampage. If you shrug off more than [143, 186, 218, 245, 268 (TL1-5; STR 100)] damage, the rampage duration increases by 1.

The amount of damage you can shrug off improves with your Strength.
